1.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-08T14:35:08Z"},"body":"Fixes #118004 \r\n\r\nTokenizer did append correct error data to the token, but the parser ignored the errors location and only forwarded the error message. As a result the reported line would come from the parsers current location rather than the location of the actual error.\r\n\r\nThis change adds a push_error(const GDScriptTokenizer::Token &p_token) overload function, without touching the old API, allowing for the full use of the error tokens data. \r\n\r\nAlso tested: \r\n- Mixed indentation inside functions, if blocks, and lambdas. \r\n- Standard parser errors still report correct locations.\r\n\r\n ## Steps to reproduce \r\n1. Create a new project and a script. \r\n3. Add this code to the script:\r\n```\r\ngdscript\r\nfunc foo() -> int:\r\n\tvar bar: int = 2 # Tab  <- Error shown here\r\n    return bar # 4 spaces   <- But should be here\r\n```\r\n## Screenshots \r\n\r\nBefore: \r\n<img width=\"1089\" height=\"295\" alt=\"2026-04-02-124313_1089x295_scrot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48963fc1-3eea-420c-862f-8921d415f7f4\" /> \r\n\r\nAfter: \r\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"295\" alt=\"2026-04-02-123838_1084x295_scrot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db805064-82e1-431c-ae34-3d79d226c3e2\" /> \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118111/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118111/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}